    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CAN AMERICAN WORLD\nAINWA1S..\nPAA\n1 N1025 V",
      "Double-decked \"Strato\" Clippers\", world's largest,\nfinest, most luxurious airliners, fly Pan American's\nexclusive \"President\" service. Only these modern\nsky giants offer you a choice of Sleeperette•\nservice or roomy berth, congenial lower deck\nlounge-unmatched travel luxury day and night.\nPRINTEO\nIN\nUGA.\n*TRADE MARK, PAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS, INC.\nWORLD'S MOST EXPERIENCED AIRLINE\nADDRESS\n20\n,489"
